  "big_o": "O(9n) 64-bit words through 1,024 total power; O(n log n) fallback",
  "summary": "A bounded 64-bit bitset finds the closest split through 1,024 total attack power, using at most nine words per bolt. Above that, deterministic strongest-first greedy places each bolt on the lighter side. The larger side attacks; the smaller becomes block up to incoming threat, with any excess kept as attack. Only a truly equal split gets the forge’s +40% bonus on both groups. Existing wards pass through.",
